% hanging_weights: a Picat model from DCP Rosetta.
%
% Thirteen weights, A to M, hang from a system of bars that must balance. Each weight is a different integer
% from 1 to 13. Every bar balances: the weights on either side of its pivot point, each multiplied by its
% distance from the pivot, are equal. A bar hanging beneath another counts as one weight equal to its total.
%
%   https://dcp-bench.github.io/DCP-Rosetta/problems/hanging_weights.html
% Save this model as model.pi and run it (Picat 3.9, https://picat-lang.org) with:
%   picat model.pi
import cp.

% The puzzle reads no data: the bars and distances are fixed in the model.
model(_Data, Vars, Outputs, Options) =>
    W = [A, B, C, D, E, F, G, H, I, J, K, L, M],   % the weights
    % the weights are integers from 1 to 13, all different
    W :: 1..13,
    all_different(W),
    % the bar holding A and B balances: 4 times A is B
    4 * A #= B,
    % the bottom right bar balances: 5 times C is D
    5 * C #= D,
    % the bar holding E and F balances: 3 times E is 2 times F
    3 * E #= 2 * F,
    % the bar holding G balances against the bar holding C and D: 3 times G is 2 times (C + D)
    3 * G #= 2 * (C + D),
    % the bar holding J and K, with the bar of A and B on one side and the bar of G, C and D on the other, balances
    3 * (A + B) + 2 * J #= K + 2 * (G + C + D),
    % the bar holding H and I balances against the bar of E and F: 3 times H is 2 times (E + F) plus 3 times I
    3 * H #= 2 * (E + F) + 3 * I,
    % the bar holding L and M balances against the bar holding H, I, E and F
    H + I + E + F #= L + 4 * M,
    % the top bar balances: the left part (L, M, H, I, E, F) at distance 4 against the right part at distance 3
    4 * (L + M + H + I + E + F) #= 3 * (J + K + G + A + B + C + D),
    Vars = W,
    Outputs = [a = A, b = B, c = C, d = D, e = E, f = F, g = G, h = H, i = I,
               j = J, k = K, l = L, m = M],
    Options = [].

main =>
    model(new_map(), Vars, Outputs, Options),
    solve(Options, Vars),
    solve(vars(Outputs)),
    foreach(Name = Value in Outputs)
        printf("%w = %w\n", Name, Value)
    end.
